m as I have been wanting to commission them for a while.\n\nI've been wanting to commission this for a while, so I decided to do it.\nTwo characters and hydrangea\n\nPlease refer to the URL (2)-1 for the characters.\nI think that the detailed parts will be crushed by the design, so please simplify them as much as possible.\nPlease simplify the atmosphere as much as possible.\n\nAlso, if possible, please make a set of Hanatsumuri's white snail child🐌,\nIf possible, could you make it look like a set of Hanatsumuri's white snail child 🐌 and make it look like they are taking a walk around a place where hydrangeas are in bloom while chatting in the rain?\nIf it's too difficult, you can use only one character.\nI'll leave the umbrellas, coats, etc. up to you. (Or you could use the leaf umbrellas you drew last time.)\n\nIf you want to make it a bit more fairy-tale, it would be fun to make the rain into candy!\n\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://x.com/Dieu_K_Itoba/status/1766662851853430793", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@87tsumuri/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1801764, "client_id": 1516673, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23399152/uploads/origins/55b043d7-051f-47bc-a504-464ab5eb7145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3a22348edb4fdb7ef785021375e63eb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23399152/uploads/origins/55b043d7-051f-47bc-a504-464ab5eb7145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3a22348edb4fdb7ef785021375e63eb, https://si.imgix.net/23399152/uploads/origins/55b043d7-051f-47bc-a504-464ab5eb7145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c674d87a458477b4300c5c6cb6ffecb8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23399152/uploads/origins/55b043d7-051f-47bc-a504-464ab5eb7145?