es, so I would like to have green in the background or somewhere else.\nI love the green color that Hanatsumuri uses, so I would like to have green in the background or somewhere else🍀.\n\nAlso, if it is possible to draw 🐌kun of Mr. Hanatsumuri's house together, I would like to ask you to do so.\nIf it is possible, and if it is difficult to do so due to compositional reasons, etc., it is totally fine if you only want to draw Kinako!\n\nI would appreciate it if you could do it.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@87tsumuri/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1801764, "client_id": 1803157, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/87c10da7/uploads/origins/14a1d213-6666-4117-95f2-56d4379cbaab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=758e5904010034687a1d82d5c1f94f29", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87c10da7/uploads/origins/14a1d213-6666-4117-95f2-56d4379cbaab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=758e5904010034687a1d82d5c1f94f29, https://si.imgix.net/87c10da7/uploads/origins/14a1d213-6666-4117-95f2-56d4379cbaab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c915e7a8004266b59e305b876f098219 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87c10da7/uploads/origins/14a1d213-6666-4117-95f2-56d4379cbaab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ea52e8e6b76c14a4049a4e571230999 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/87c10da7/uploads/origins/14a1d213-6666-4117-95f2-56d4379cbaab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e95a65f9127468e687a6de3b885f22a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87c10da7/uploads/origins/14a1d213-6666-4117-95f2-56d4379cbaab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre