りましたら申し訳ございません。\n可能でしたらよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://misskey.design/@sun/pages/1684856875944", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@87tsumuri/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1801764, "client_id": 107719, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=967e67e7bbe58101572158cdd17624c6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=967e67e7bbe58101572158cdd17624c6, https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d38260e7a3cc9cd883f4da80002af644 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9127934f6e685d0b5888c6bc1d32e37a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81de93707728e35a336e7bfa5397edee", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81de93707728e35a336e7bfa5397edee, https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7712cb4240785c5273b2c7806330bf8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a823adc9/uploads/origins/b4073495-4ab5-4ce0-b2bc-294d0e241d8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58e4403f00b9c33078d7183f64ed6411 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I saw your work on misskey.io.\nI saw your work on misskey.io and thought it had the perfect atmosphere for what I was thinking of, so I would like to commission you to do it.\n\nCharacter\nDatenchi Yua (Vtuber) (registered in the official program for secondary works)\nYuakon (character related to Datenchi Yua) (pink slime with a six-pointed star on its forehead ༼*˙˙* ༽)\n\n[Image.\nSoft, warm, and slightly blurred, like a picture book spread\n\nSituation\nDatenchi Yuah\" is surprised to find herself suddenly growing rabbit ears.\nThe little \"Yuakon\" who is surprised to see them and is unaware that he too is shaped like a rabbit's ear.\nA stray rabbit (animal) with a face that doesn't know what it's doing, just being nearby\n\nIt is not necessary to show the whole body as long as you can see the surprised face of \"Datenchi Yua\".\nAs for the costume, please use a simplified or arranged version of the current costume to make it easier for us to draw.\nSpring flowers and grasses would be appreciated.\nPlease feel free to choose the type, color, and composition of the rabbits.\nI think a flower crown is also possible.\n\n[Materials\nCurrent costume\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/98711578\nOfficial settings (including \"yuakon\")\nhttps://datenti-yua.fanbox.cc/posts/382385\nBunny ears meme\nhttps://twitter.com/datenti_yua/status/1653305295555424256\n\n[Works registered with the Secondary Creation Authorization Program\nhttps://medium.com/skeb-jp/ugc-program-titles-c3de542def31\n\nRemarks\nIf possible, please do not put the file with the address at the top.\nIt would be helpful if only signatures or Commission~from... or no letters are at the top.\n\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://datenti-yua.fanbox.cc/posts/382385", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@87tsumuri/works/2", "privat