and the way you write lines.\nI think you probably don't know this character, but is it OK?\nWe would be happy if you would consider our proposal.\nWorks\nFlower Knight Girl\nCharacter\nBoth appearances can be found at the URL below.\n1) Soyogo and Soyogo's Bird\nhttps://xn--eckq7fg8cygsa1a1je.xn--wiki-4i9hs14f.com/index.php?%E3%82%BD%E3%83%A8%E3%82%B4\n(2) Flowers and fruits of Soyogo\n https://lovegreen.net/gardentree/p274640/#:~:text=%E3%82%BD%E3%83%A8%E3%82%B4%E3%81%AE%E8%8A%B1%E3%81%AF%E7%9B%B4%E5%BE%84,%E3%81%AE%E9%95%B7%E3%81%84%E6%9F%84%E3%81%8C%E3%81%82%E3%82%8A%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99%E3%80%82\nClothing\nThe choice of clothing is left to the discretion of the teacher.\nCharacter URL destination Normal costume or one-piece dress\nSituation.\nWe would like a picture of Soyogo playing nicely with his partner bird.\nIf possible, we would also like to see the flower or fruit of Soyogo, her original subject, but if this is difficult to achieve, please feel free to ignore it.\n\nIf there are any other points that are unclear, you may arrange them at your discretion.\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@87tsumuri/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1801764, "client_id": 1890513, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a3e691a/uploads/origins/135ee0d8-164d-4805-bdc6-04c75c3cabdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcdcbdb54a0e38b8ecb5063e9447e1bf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a3e691a/uploads/origins/135ee0d8-164d-4805-bdc6-04c75c3cabdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcdcbdb54a0e38b8ecb5063e9447e1bf, https://si.imgix.net/3a3e691a/uploads/origins/135ee0d8-164d-4805-bdc6-04c75c3cabdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bcf0a6067ad99c637d6c